VGGT-Omega (Meta Platforms, Inc.)
---------------------------------
crates/vggt-omega ports the VGGT-Omega model (Wang et al., CVPR 2026;
https://github.com/facebookresearch/vggt-omega) and loads its released weights. VGGT-Omega is
made available by Meta under the FAIR Noncommercial Research License; a copy of that agreement,
including the FAIR Acceptable Use Policy, is in LICENSE-VGGT-OMEGA. We acknowledge the use of
these Research Materials.

The VGGT-Omega weights are not part of this repository or of its Docker image. Users download
them from Hugging Face (facebook/VGGT-Omega) after accepting the licence. Outputs and results of
the weights may be used for noncommercial research only.

