SageAttention
-------------
crates/rawatta-nn/cuda/sage_*.cu and crates/rawatta-nn/src/sage/ are an independent
implementation of the algorithms of SageAttention, SageAttention2 and SageAttention2++
(Zhang et al.; arXiv 2410.02367, 2411.10958, 2505.21136). The FP8 P-fragment key permutation
and the two-level P.V accumulation follow those papers and the reference code at
https://github.com/thu-ml/SageAttention (Apache License 2.0). No SageAttention source file is
included.

The +log(count) bias of merged keys follows the proportional attention of ToMe and GPA-VGGT.
The bf16 attention kernel (crates/rawatta-nn/cuda/attention.cu) was written from the
FlashAttention-2 paper (Dao, 2023); no FlashAttention code is used.


Other upstream code used by the research harnesses
--------------------------------------------------
research/ (unsupported) vendors no model code: research/setup.sh clones the pinned repositories
it needs (GPA-VGGT, sparse-vggt with its vggt, SpargeAttn and Pi3 submodules) at run time; check
each repository's and model's licence before use. The replacement attention forward in
research/vggt1b_sched.py and research/v3_generality.py follows the structure of
Attention.forward in https://github.com/facebookresearch/vggt.


