from the crate metadata of the dependency graph of rawatta-cli on Linux x86_64:

  - mozjpeg 0.10 and mozjpeg-sys 2.2 (IJG AND Zlib AND BSD-3-Clause): the mozjpeg / libjpeg-turbo
    JPEG decoder, built from source. This software is based in part on the work of the
    Independent JPEG Group.
  - cudarc 0.19 (MIT OR Apache-2.0): CUDA driver, NVRTC and cuBLASLt bindings; the CUDA libraries
    themselves are loaded at run time and are not part of the binary.
  - libloading (ISC); rgb, simd-adler32, strsim, tracing, tracing-attributes, tracing-core,
    winnow, zmij (MIT); zlib-rs (Zlib); moxcms, pxfm (BSD-3-Clause OR Apache-2.0); byteorder-lite, memchr
    (Unlicense OR MIT); unicode-ident ((MIT OR Apache-2.0) AND Unicode-3.0).
